        "Content": "No. 45 Bru na Mara,  Donegal Town  F94 R202\r\n\r\n3 B/r Duplex Town House\r\n\r\nin Excellent Condition\r\n\r\nSituate in a quiet sheltered part of Bru na Mara;  Constructed in 2006 and extending to 100.56 sq.m.  Comprising -\r\n\r\nLiving Room,  Kitchen with Dining Area,  W.C.;  3 No. Bedrooms (1 en-suite) & Bathroom.\r\n\r\nDual Central Heating -  Gas Fired & Solid Fuel \t\t\t\t\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nEntrance Hallway\t\t5.86 m.  x  1.99 m.\r\n\t\t\t\ttiled floor\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nW.C.\t\t\t\tToilet & Wash Basin\r\n\r\nLiving Room\t\t\t4.98 m.  x  3.07 m.\r\n\t\t\t\tlaminated floor; fireplace with timber surround and enclosed \t\t\t\tsolid fuel stove (heats radiators and water)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nKitchen / Dining\t\t5.18 m.  x  3.60 m.\r\n\t\t\t\ttiled floor;  fitted units with built-in oven and electric hob; \t\t\t\tplumbed for washing machine;  Sliding Door overlooking rear \t\t\t\tgarden\r\n\r\n  \r\n\r\nLanding\r\n\r\nHot Press\r\n\r\nBedroom No. 1\t\t3.11 m.  x  2.15 m.\r\n\t\t\t\tlaminated floor, \t\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom No. 2\t\t3.01 m.  x  2.91 m.  \r\n\t\t\t\tlaminated floor;  storage closet\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom No. 3\t\t4.39 m.  x  2.94 m.\r\n\t\t\t\tlaminated floor\r\n\r\n\t\tEn-suite\tElectric shower, toilet and wash basin; fully tiled\r\n\r\n  \r\n\r\n  \r\n\r\nBathroom\t\t\t2.07 m.  x  1.81 m.\r\n\t\t\t\tBath, toilet and wash basin; tiled floor and lower walls\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nGas Fired  & Solid Fuel Central Heating\r\n\r\nLiving Area\r\n\r\nGarden at rear\r\n\r\nBER -\tB \t\tBer No. 119788453"
